# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 058B:017C"
msgid "Knave, I find you guilty of theft. "
msgstr "無賴，我判你偷竊罪成立。"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 058B:01BC"
msgid "Knave, I find you guilty of assault. "
msgstr "無賴，我判你傷害罪成立。"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 058B:021C"
msgid "And so... I sentence you to death. "
msgstr "因此……我判你死刑。"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 058B:0297"
msgid "I call upon the power of the Cabal and consign you to the flames! "
msgstr "我召喚密謀會的力量，將你交付烈焰！"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 058B:0710"
msgid "What foul deed is this? "
msgstr "這是什麼惡行？"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 058B:075A"
msgid "You did this! "
msgstr "是你幹的！"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 058B:07ED"
